# by the Toolkit when generating unique Intermediate and Temporary file
# names.  The Toolkit no longer relies on the PGS_HOST_PATH environment
# variable to obtain this information. (DO NOT REMOVE THIS ENTRY)      
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
